 value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025, June to July on the middle of the grids came in at 20% of normal and July to August at 43%. Grid 30635 had its driest year in 1976 at 62% of normal. So far in 2026, January to February on the middle of the grids sits at 63%.</p>"}
